  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Sometime you just want certain accessory color go back to original, but you already edited the color on another edit, so there will be no undo. And there's no 'new' accessory button, only copying, which won't provide you the original colors since it's exact copy of the edited one. The only way is to open another looks and copy the codes from there, which is less conveniences",
